@startuml F5.12-D02-bulk-deliberate
title F5.12-D02 — Aprovar ou rejeitar em lote
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar lote
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /requests/bulk-deliberate
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT FOR UPDATE
Postgres --> Ctrl: N linhas ABERTA
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE + events\n+ outbox × N + audit
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: status atualizado

@enduml
